==In the side series games==
===Pokémon Stadium 2===
In [[Pokémon Stadium 2]], a Kimono Girl is present in the game's main menu. In [[White City]], two Kimono Girls can be battled in two different areas; Naomi appears in [[Earl's Pokémon Academy]] to teach the player about the importance of [[Held item|held]] {{Berries}}, while Emiko appears in the [[Great Ball|Great]] and [[Master Ball]] divisions of the [[Challenge Cup]].

